sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor F as Family member
  actor H as Hospital doctor
  participant W as Web app
  participant A as API
  participant D as PostgreSQL
  participant S as Object storage
  F->>W: Tap "Emergency card"
  W->>A: POST /emergency-card
  A->>A: Random 32-byte token, SHA-256 hash
  A->>D: emergency_cards (hash only), audit row
  A->>D: Read current plan, allergies first
  A->>S: Render PDF and image, store keys
  A-->>W: Card + QR for /e/token (token shown once)
  F->>H: Show phone, print, or send on WhatsApp
  H->>A: GET /e/token (no login)
  A->>D: Look up by hash: expired? revoked?
  alt valid
    A->>D: SET LOCAL app.public_card_patient_id, read-only policies
    A->>D: access log row (ok)
    A-->>H: Live card, last-updated time, "verify with family"
  else expired, revoked or unknown
    A->>D: access log row (expired, revoked, not_found)
    A-->>H: Neutral "link not available" page
  end
